# Lab 02: Verification of XOR and XNOR Gates

## Objective
To study and verify the truth tables and outputs of XOR (Exclusive-OR) and XNOR (Exclusive-NOR) logic gates.

## Theory & Truth Tables

### 1. XOR Gate (Exclusive-OR)
The XOR gate gives a HIGH (1) output when the inputs are different (one is HIGH, the other is LOW). If both inputs are the same, the output is LOW (0).


### 2. XNOR Gate (Exclusive-NOR)
The XNOR gate is the complement of the XOR gate. It gives a HIGH (1) output when both inputs are the same (both HIGH or both LOW).



## Result
I have successfully verified the truth tables and outputs of both the XOR and XNOR gates.
